    description: "HYPERGUMBO_VERBOSE (used in sketch.py:1719) and HYPERGUMBO_MIN_MEMORY_MB (used in analyze/base.py:56) are referenced in source but not documented in docs/, README, AGENTS.md, or CHANGELOG. Compare to HYPERGUMBO_CACHE_HONK_GB (documented in spec) and HYPERGUMBO_RUST_ANALYZER (documented in spec + CHANGELOG). Additionally: HF_HUB_OFFLINE=1 is the known workaround for INV-dasig (huggingface.co network on first install) but is not documented anywhere in hypergumbo's own docs — users have no way to discover this offline-mode opt-in. Suggested fix: add an 'Environment Variables' section to docs/hypergumbo-spec.md covering all four HYPERGUMBO_* vars plus the HF_HUB_OFFLINE workaround."  # c5d7
    fields: {}  # c5d7
